{
  "Npcs.Cockatrice.Desc": "The cockatrice before you stands at about . The harpy/basilisk hybrid hops from one clawed foot to the other, its turquoise neck ruff puffed out. From the creature's flat chest and tight butt, you assume that it must be male. He watches you, his electric-blue eyes glinting as his midnight-blue tail swishes behind him. Every so often he lunges forward, beak open before revealing it was a feint. He is wielding his sharp claws as a weapon and is shielded only by his exotic plumage and scaled limbscream, scaled belly. Every so often he spreads his large feathered wings in an attempt to intimidate you. His lizard-like feet occasionally gouge into the rubble of the plateau, flinging it up as he shifts his stance.\" // TODO 原文含表达式，只取了字面量"
  "Npcs.Cockatrice.Name": "Cockatrice"
}
